msgid "&Common background"
msgstr "Fond co&mon inte les scribannes"

#: backgnd.cpp:139
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Choose the desktop whose background you want to modify. If you want the same "
"background settings to be applied to all desktops, check the \"Common "
"Background\" option, and this list will be disabled."
msgstr ""
"Tchoezixhoz li scribanne ki vos vloz candjî si fond. Si vos vloz l' minme "
"apontiaedje do fond po tos les scribannes, clitchîz l' tchuze «Fond comon "
"inte les scribannes», eyet cisse djivêye chal serè-st essoctêye."

#: backgnd.cpp:143
msgid ""
"Check this option if you want to have the same background settings for all "
"desktops. If this option is not checked, the background settings can be "
"customized for each desktop."
msgstr ""
"Clitchîz cisse tchuze chal si vos vloz li minme apontiaedje do fond po tos "
"les scribannes. Si cisse tchuze chal n' est nén clitcheye, les "
"apontiaedjes do fond polèt esse diferins po tchaeke sicribanne."

#: backgnd.cpp:156
msgid ""
"In this monitor, you can preview how your settings will look like on a "
"\"real\" desktop."
msgstr ""
"Dins cisse waitroûle chal, vos ploz vey kimint ki vos apontiaedjes vont "
"esse on côp k' i sront metous en alaedje sol sicribanne."

#: backgnd.cpp:175
