msgid "&Background"
msgstr "&Fond del waitroûle"

#: backgnd.cpp:180 bgdialogs.cpp:680
msgid "&Mode:"
msgstr "&Môde:"

#: backgnd.cpp:193
msgid ""
"You can select the manner in which the background is painted. The choices "
"are: "
"<ul>"
"<li><em>Flat:</em> Use a solid color (\"Color 1\").</li> "
"<li><em>Pattern:</em>"
" Use a two-color pattern. Click \"Setup\" to choose the pattern.</li> "
"<li><em>Gradients:</em> Blend two colors using a predefined gradient "
"(horizontal, vertical, etc.).</li> "
"<li><em>Program:</em> Use an application which paints the background, for "
"example, with a day/night map of the world that is refreshed periodically. "
"Click \"Setup\" to select and configure the program.</li></ul>"
msgstr ""
"Vos ploz tchoezi l' manire di gålioter li fond del waitroûle.Les tchuzes "
"sont: "
"<ul>"
"<li><em>Plat:</em> Ene seule solide coleur (\"Coleur 1\").</li> "
"<li><em>Patron:</em> On patron avou deus coleurs. Clitchîz so "
"«Apontiaedje» po tchoezi l' patron.</li> "
"<li><em>Dégradés:</em> Maxhaedje di deus coleurs shuvant on degradé dné "
"(di coûtchî, d' astampé, evnd.).</li> "
"<li><em>Programe:</em> On programe e-st eployî po rimpli l' fond del "
"waitroûle, par egzimpe, avou ene mape e tins reyel del daegn. Clitchîz so "
"«Apontiaedje» po tchoezi eyet apontyî li programe.</li></ul>"

